      "prompt_hash": "2eebecfb3e38d5dc",
      "draft": "Nicco held the boots out toward Bartolomhew.\n\nBartolomhew glanced down at the offered pair, then back up at Nicco. The pleasant smile didn't waver. He raised a hand, palm out, and gave a small shake of his head. \"Keep them. I have my own, and a man new to the city walks a great deal more than he expects.\" His voice carried the same warm, unhurried courtesy. \"Besides, they were a gift. It would be poor manners to take a gift back.\"\n\nHe let his hand drop to his side and waited, still smiling, as if the matter were entirely settled.",
